[by:如墨入地]
[00:00.00]作词 : Volker Hinkel/Peter Freudenthaler
[00:01.00]作曲 : Volker Hinkel/Peter Freudenthaler
[00:12.69]I'm sitting here in a boring room.
[00:12.69]我呆坐在这了无生趣的房间
[00:17.29]It's just another rainy Sunday afternoon.
[00:17.29]又是一个周日的午后，又是阴雨连绵
[00:19.84]I'm wasting my time, I got nothing to do.
[00:19.84]我无事可做，我空耗着时间
[00:23.26]I'm hanging around, I'm waiting for you.
[00:23.26]我不安地徘徊，我期待着你的出现
[00:26.40]But nothing ever happens, and I wonder.
[00:26.40]但是你终究没有出现，我纳闷
[00:32.34]
[00:33.89]I'm driving around in my car.
[00:33.89]我出去转转，驾着我的车
[00:37.02]I'm driving too fast, I'm driving too far.
[00:37.02]我开得太快，我开得太远
[00:40.41]I'd like to change my point of view.
[00:40.41]我宁愿转移一下我的注意力
[00:43.69]I feel so lonely, I'm waiting for you.
[00:43.69]我仍感到如此孤单，我期待着你的出现
[00:47.20]But nothing ever happens, and I wonder.
[00:47.20]但是你终究没有出现，我纳闷
[00:52.39]
[00:54.00]I wonder how, I wonder why.
[00:54.00]我不知所措，我不明所以
[00:57.37]Yesterday you told me about the blue, blue sky.
[00:57.37]昨天你给我描绘那蓝色的、蓝色的天空
[01:01.02]And all that I can see is just a yellow lemon tree.
[01:01.02]但是我所看见的只有一株黄色的柠檬树
[01:08.19]I'm turning my head up and down.
[01:08.19]我转着我的头，上上下下
[01:11.18]I'm turning, turning, turning, turning, turning around.
[01:11.18]我转啊、转啊、转啊、转啊、一遍又一遍
[01:14.25]And all that I can see is just another lemon tree.
[01:14.25]我所看见的只是另一株柠檬树
[01:23.72]
[01:35.07]I'm sitting here, and I miss the power.
[01:35.07]我呆坐在这，我精疲力尽
[01:38.60]I'd like to go out taking a shower.
[01:38.60]我宁愿出去沐浴一下
[01:41.83]But there's a heavy cloud inside my head.
[01:41.83]但是这片阴云总在在我头脑中挥之不去
[01:45.05]I feel so tired, and put myself into bed.
[01:45.05]我感到如此疲惫，我把自己扔到了床上
[01:48.48]Well nothing ever happens, and I wonder.
[01:48.48]但是你终究没有出现，我纳闷
[01:53.70]
[01:54.74]Isolation is not good for me, isolation I don't want to sit on the lemon tree
[01:54.74]自我封闭对我并无益处，自我封闭……我可不想坐死在这柠檬树上
[02:08.20]I'm stepping around in a desert of joy.
[02:08.20]我在快乐的荒漠中漫步
[02:12.27]Baby, anyhow I get another toy.
[02:12.27]天呐，无论如何我要找到另一个玩具
[02:15.66]And everything will happen, and you wonder.
[02:15.66]所有的事情都可能发生，这你知道
[02:20.48]
[02:23.39]I wonder how, I wonder why.
[02:23.39]我不知所措，我不明所以
[02:26.09]Yesterday you told me about the blue, blue sky.
[02:26.09]昨天你给我描绘那蓝色的、蓝色的天空
